{"s":107,"v":[{"t":"Have you seen the one who denies the Recompense?","w":[["أَرَءَيْتَ","Have you seen","ara-ayta","",[["أَ",31],["رَءَيْ",60],["تَ",18]]],["ٱلَّذِى","the one who","alladhī",""],["يُكَذِّبُ","denies","yukadhibu",""],["بِٱلدِّينِ","the Judgment","bil-dīni","",[["بِ",10],["ٱل",2],["دِّينِ",136]]]]},{"t":"For that is the one who drives away the orphan","w":[["فَذَٰلِكَ","Then that","fadhālika","",[["فَ",7],["ذَٰ",32],["لِ",0],["كَ",0]]],["ٱلَّذِى","(is) the one who","alladhī",""],["يَدُعُّ","repulses","yaduʿʿu",""],["ٱلْيَتِيمَ","the orphan","l-yatīma","",[["ٱلْ",2],["يَتِيمَ",463]]]]},{"t":"And does not encourage the feeding of the poor.","w":[["وَلَا","And (does) not","walā","",[["وَ",1],["لَا",13]]],["يَحُضُّ","feel the urge","yaḥuḍḍu",""],["عَلَىٰ","to","ʿalā",""],["طَعَامِ","feed","ṭaʿāmi",""],["ٱلْمِسْكِينِ","the poor","l-mis'kīni","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مِسْكِينِ",462]]]]},{"t":"So woe to those who pray","w":[["فَوَيْلٌۭ","So woe","fawaylun","",[["فَ",7],["وَيْلٌۭ",309]]],["لِّلْمُصَلِّينَ","to those who pray","lil'muṣallīna","",[["لِّ",8],["لْ",2],["مُصَلِّينَ",2010]]]]},{"t":"[But] who are heedless of their prayer -","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who","alladhīna",""],["هُمْ","[they]","hum",""],["عَن","about","ʿan",""],["صَلَاتِهِمْ","their prayers","ṣalātihim","",[["صَلَاتِ",152],["هِمْ",3]]],["سَاهُونَ","(are) neglectful","sāhūna",""]]},{"t":"Those who make show [of their deeds]","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who","alladhīna",""],["هُمْ","[they]","hum",""],["يُرَآءُونَ","make show","yurāūna","",[["يُرَآءُ",2813],["ونَ",3]]]]},{"t":"And withhold [simple] assistance.","w":[["وَيَمْنَعُونَ","And they deny","wayamnaʿūna","",[["وَ",1],["يَمْنَعُ",742],["ونَ",3]]],["ٱلْمَاعُونَ","[the] small kindnesses","l-māʿūna","",[["ٱلْ",2],["مَاعُونَ",4116]]]]}]}